GROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">금상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">동상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">특별상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">수상</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대만 국제발명품 전시회 특징</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&