NG: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대만 정부가 지원하는 공신력 있는 발명전시회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 8. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">출품지원금 지원 및 혜택</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -50.5pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개인 및 중소기업자의 최소부스료</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">번역비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">통역비 항목에 한해 발명품</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">건 당 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">최대 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">1,000,000</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">원 이내 지원 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">연말 추가금액 지급 가능</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></u></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -50.5pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGRO