#ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">각 기업 소재 지방자치단체의 해외전시회 활용 지원 프로그램을 적극</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -59.6pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 적으로 활용시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">참가비 지원 혜택 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">출품 시 우리회 온라인 전시관 발명품 등록</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">*</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">단 연례 실적조사 동의 시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">국제발명전시회에 관심있는 학생들은 창업교육센터(054-478-6948)로 연락주시면 경진대회 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">참가경비를 지원해드립니다. 전시회에 대한 자세한 내용은 첨부파일 참조바랍니다.</span></p></span></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
